+## Other extensions of SummarizedExperiment
+
+Beyond `SCE` and `TreeSE`, `SE` has been extended for many other purposes.
+Although these extensions were not developed specifically for microbiome data,
+they can be useful for it in certain cases. Examples include
+`r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("SpatialExperiment")` for
+spatially resolved data, `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("GraphExperiment")` for
+graph-structured data, `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("DeeDeeExperiment")` for storing
+differential analysis results, and `r BiocStyle::Biocpkg("ReducedExperiment")`
+for dimensionality reduction results together with their feature loadings.
+These classes build on the same `SE` structure, so the skills covered in this
+book carry over to them. You do not need them to follow this book.
+:::
